u-to-the-propertylist-community%2F&amp;format=xml\">\n    \n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en-GB\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/general-information/big-thank-you-to-the-propertylist-community/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es-ES\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/es/informacion-general/muchas-gracias-a-la-comunidad-propertylist/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/general-information/big-thank-you-to-the-propertylist-community/\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/es/informacion-general/muchas-gracias-a-la-comunidad-propertylist/\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/favicon-48x48.png\" sizes=\"48x48\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/favicon.svg\">\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/favicon.ico\">\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n<meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"PropertyList\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/fbrfg/site.webmanifest\">\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<link rel=\"pingback\" href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/xmlrpc.php\"><meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Elementor 3.27.3; features: e_font_icon_svg, additional_custom_breakpoints; settings: css_print_method-external, google_font-enabled, font_display-swap\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"//code.tidio.co\">\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"WP Super Duper v1.2.17\" data-sd-source=\"userswp\"><meta name=\"generator\" content=\"WP Font Awesome Settings v1.1.7\" data-ac-source=\"userswp\">    \n\n    \n\n\t\n\t\t<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n<noscript></noscript>\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\t\t\n        \n\n\n\n        <div class=\"body_wrapper \">\n            <div class=\"click_capture\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"side_menu  menu_purple\"><div class=\"mobile_nav_wrapper\"><nav class=\"mobile_nav_bottom\"><div><br></div>        </nav>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"tip_banner_area\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-9 m-auto\">\n                <h1 class=\"banner_title\">Big Thank You to the PropertyList Community!</h1>                    <div class=\"single_post_author d-flex justify-content-center\">\n        <div class=\"text post_tag\">\n                            <a href=\"https://info.propertylist.es/2025/02/27/\" class=\"meta-item date\">\n                    <ion-icon name=\"calendar-outline\"></ion-icon>\n                    February 27, 2025                </a>\n                                <div class=\"meta-item read-time\" title=\"3 minutes to read this post\"><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"blog_area tip_doc_area\" id=\"sticky_doc2\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-8 blog_single_info\"><div class=\"main-post \"><div class=\"blog_single_item editor-content\"><div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"17051\" class=\"elementor elementor-17051\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60890023 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"60890023\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-765873d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"765873d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Thank You, PropertyList Community, for an Incredible Launch! <br></strong><strong>Claim your FREE CREDITS below!</strong></p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>We are absolutely thrilled to extend our heartfelt gratitude to the entire PropertyList.es community of estate agents for making our portal launch a resounding success. Your enthusiastic participation and unwavering support have truly made all the difference.</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p><strong>A Growing Community</strong></p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>With <strong>over 300 agencies</strong> and nearly <strong>400 users</strong> already on board, the PropertyList platform is rapidly becoming the go-to destination for real estate professionals in Andalucía. Your commitment to sharing and listing properties has resulted in an impressive database of <strong>over 2,700 properties</strong> available for potential buyers and renters—all achieved <strong>within just 10 days</strong>. This collaborative effort is a testament to the power of our community and the value we bring to the real estate market.</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p><strong>Exciting Times Ahead</strong></p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>We are incredibly excited about the future of PropertyList.es, and we have some fantastic developments in the pipeline that we can’t wait to share with you. Our goal is to continually enhance the platform to better serve your needs and help you succeed in your real estate endeavours.</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p><strong>Remember, It’s FREE!</strong></p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>Don’t forget that it’s completely free to list and share your direct listings on PropertyList.es. By showcasing your properties on our platform, you gain access to a wider audience and increase your chances of closing deals. Additionally, you have the option to pay-as-you-go features to highlight your properties in front of others on the MLS platform, giving you a competitive edge.</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p><strong>Automated CRM for Seamless Management</strong></p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>We are proud to offer a full-fledged automated CRM system to help you manage your listings, sales pipeline, and event calendar effortlessly. This powerful tool ensures that you stay organised and on top of your game, making it easier than ever to grow your business.</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p><strong>Thank You!</strong></p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>Once again, thank you for being a part of the PropertyList.es community. Your trust and collaboration are the driving forces behind our success, and we are honoured to have you with us on this journey. Together, we are building something extraordinary, and the best is yet to come!</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>Stay tuned for more updates and exciting announcements. Let’s continue to grow, succeed, and make a positive impact on the real estate market in Andalucía and beyond.</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\n<p>With gratitude,<br>James Wood &amp; The PropertyList Team</p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67dfc51 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"67dfc51\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">CLAIM 30 FREE CREDITS</h3>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b4d76da elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b4d76da\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">🎉 <strong>As a token of our appreciation, we’re excited to offer you 30 free credits worth €30!</strong> You can use these credits to “Feature” your listings, making them stand out in front of others. And there’s more to come!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Click the button below an send<strong> #PropertyList</strong> <br>to claim your FREE credits.<br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">*offer ends 10 March 2025</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd85157 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"fd85157\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">Claim 30 Credits (expired)</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc08c68 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dc08c68\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Not joined yet? Sign up for FREE today!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"simple_footer\"><div class=\"container custom_container\"><div class=\"row align-items-center\"><div class=\"col-sm-6 text-right\"><ul class=\"list-unstyled f_social_icon\">\n        \n        \n                        </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</footer>\n</div> <!-- Body Wrapper -->\n\n    <a id=\"back-to-top\" title=\"Back to Top\" class=\"right\"></a>\n        <div id=\"reading-progress\"><div id=\"reading-progress-fill\"></div></div>\n    <template id=\"tp-language\" data-tp-language=\"en_GB\"></template><div class=\"trp_model_container\" id=\"trp_ald_modal_container\" style=\"display: none\" data-no-dynamic-translation=\"\" data-no-translation=\"\">\n        <div class=\"trp_ald_modal\" id=\"trp_ald_modal_popup\">\n            <div id=\"trp_ald_popup_text\"><